OTOGAKURE — COMPOUND ORIENTATION
RESTRICTED: assigned personnel only

The Hidden Sound is not one village but a network of hidden bases scattered across the
Land of Sound and neighboring territories. Lord Orochimaru maintains many lairs so that
no single loss compromises the whole. Learn only the areas your duty requires.

Primary Compound — Zones
- Zone A: Reception and holding cells. Prisoners and incoming subjects processed here.
- Zone B: Medic wing and operating theaters. Curse-seal application and modification are
  performed here. Restricted to medic cadre and escorted subjects.
- Zone C: Research vaults. Specimen storage, kekkei genkai samples, sealed archives.
  Head Medic clearance required.
- Zone D: Barracks and training halls for operatives and the guard.
- Zone E: Lord Orochimaru's private quarters and laboratory. No entry without summons.

Movement Rules
- Corridors reconfigure; do not rely on memory of a route you were not shown.
- Underground passages connect the lairs. Passage keys are issued per assignment and
  surrendered on completion.
- If you are lost, remain where you are and signal. Wandering into a restricted zone is
  treated as intrusion.

Destroy this notice if capture is imminent.
